# A treadmill, one tile wide and two deep, facing up. The console screen
# glows, the handrails run down the first tile, and the belt loops through
# both. The runner stands on the second tile facing the console; zbias -1
# paints the deck under them.
sprite gym-treadmill
size 16 44
layer object
footprint 1 2
origin 0 12
zbias -1
fps 8
tag treadmill exercise gym
spot run 0 1 up exercise stand
light 8 4 16 #63dccf 0.4

